Zanne AE, Tank DC, Cornwell WK, Eastman JM, Smith SA, FitzJohn RG, McGlinn DJ, O'Meara BC, Moles AT, Reich PB, et al. (2014). Three keys to the radiation of angiosperms into freezing environments. *Nature* 506: 89-92. <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature12872>
